@host = https://localhost:7168

### Pre-submission document verification
POST {{host}}/api/screening
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": "ATN-12345",
  "mode": "DocVerification"
}

### Post-submission screening
POST {{host}}/api/screening
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicationId": "ATN-12345",
  "mode": "Screening"
}

### Read persisted comments
GET {{host}}/api/screening/comments
Accept: application/json
